<TITLE>Fuel Delivery Pipe</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A resin delivery pipe has been adopted to reduce weight.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The left and right fuel delivery pipes are connected by a nylon tube.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A fuel pulsation damper is provided on the right bank fuel delivery pipe to suppress fuel pulsation, stabilizing the air-fuel ratio and reducing noise.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
